{"name":"Delicious","hex":"#585e46","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"delicious","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Pleasing to the sense of taste; tasty.","Pleasing to a person's taste; pleasing to the eyes or mind."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/delicious"}],"entries":[{"title":"Golden Delicious","blocks":[{"text":"Golden Delicious is a cultivar of apple from the United States, where it is one of the top varieties. Despite its name, it is not closely related to Red Delicious."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Golden_Delicious_apples.jpg/330px-Golden_Delicious_apples.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Golden_Delicious","wikidata":"Q201996"},{"title":"Red Delicious","blocks":[{"text":"Red Delicious is a variety of apple with a red exterior and sweet taste. Known as \"the Reds\" in the industry, this variety is the result of a chance seedling. It was first recognized in Madison County, Iowa, United States, in 1872. Despite its name, it is not related to the Golden Delicious."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Red_delicious_and_cross_section.jpg/330px-Red_delicious_and_cross_section.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Red_Delicious","wikidata":"Q2117265"},{"title":"Delicious (website)","blocks":[{"text":"Delicious was a social bookmarking web service for storing, sharing, and discovering web bookmarks. The site was founded by Joshua Schachter and Peter Gadjokov in 2003 and acquired by Yahoo! in 2005. By the end of 2008, the service claimed more than 5.3 million users and 180 million unique bookmarked URLs. Yahoo sold Delicious to AVOS Systems in April 2011, and the site relaunched in a \"back to beta\" state on September 27 that year. In May 2014, AVOS sold the site to Science Inc. In January 2016 Delicious Media, a new alliance, reported it had assumed control of the service."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/8/80/Delicious_screenshot.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Delicious_(website)","wikidata":"Q329192"},{"title":"Delicious (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Delicious is a British drama television series starring Dawn French and Emilia Fox. The first four-part series, written by Dan Sefton and directed by Clare Kilner and John Hardwick, premiered on Sky One on 30 December 2016. A second season followed, and the third and final season ended on 18 January 2019."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Delicious_(TV_series)","wikidata":"Q30612313"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Starr_070730-7802_Malus_pumila.jpg/500px-Starr_070730-7802_Malus_pumila.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Starr_070730-7802_Malus_pumila.jpg/1280px-Starr_070730-7802_Malus_pumila.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Starr_070730-7802_Malus_pumila.jpg/500px-Starr_070730-7802_Malus_pumila.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Color is uniform yellow, with an occasional red blush","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AStarr_070730-7802_Malus_pumila.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Golden_delicious.jpg/500px-Golden_delicious.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Golden_delicious.jpg/500px-Golden_delicious.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Golden delicious apples generally are of uniform color but can show considerable russeting around the stem end of the fruit. Grown in Albemarle County, Virginia.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGolden_delicious.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/GoldenDeliciousApple.jpg/500px-GoldenDeliciousApple.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/GoldenDeliciousApple.jpg/1280px-GoldenDeliciousApple.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/GoldenDeliciousApple.jpg/500px-GoldenDeliciousApple.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Speckles on the skin are normal","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGoldenDeliciousApple.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/Golden_Delicious_Apple_Seed.JPG/500px-Golden_Delicious_Apple_Seed.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/Golden_Delicious_Apple_Seed.JPG/1280px-Golden_Delicious_Apple_Seed.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/Golden_Delicious_Apple_Seed.JPG/500px-Golden_Delicious_Apple_Seed.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Seed","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGolden_Delicious_Apple_Seed.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/Jabuka_Zlatni_deli%C5%A1es_-_klon_B.JPG/500px-Jabuka_Zlatni_deli%C5%A1es_-_klon_B.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/Jabuka_Zlatni_deli%C5%A1es_-_klon_B.JPG/1280px-Jabuka_Zlatni_deli%C5%A1es_-_klon_B.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_co